# 统一换行符：仓库内文本文件一律使用 LF，避免 Windows 检出转换造成无意义 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理与 PowerShell 脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Shell 与 Gradle 脚本保持 LF（供 Linux / macOS 执行）
*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换与文本合并
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.zip binary
*.aab binary
*.apk binary
*.ipa binary

# 文档标记为 documentation，不计入语言统计
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
